		(property "Description" "H3a(c): CAN pair common-mode-choke position, PROVISIONED DNP as EMC insurance (never series beads on individual CAN lines). Real part if ever populated: TDK ACT45B-510-2P-TL003, CAN-bus-rated SMD-4P 4.5x3.2mm, 51uH/line, 177k LCSC stock (verified 2026-07-03). NO FOOTPRINT assigned yet -- no SMD-4P land exists in lib/vendor; add one at the W6 PCB placement pass before this can be populated. CONTINUITY: R11/R12 are the populated-by-default 0R bypasses bridging each CAN line across this DNP position (RJ45-side segment to U2-side segment); the EMC variant = remove R11/R12 + fit FL1. Never fit both (a fitted CMC in parallel with 0R bypasses is shorted out and does nothing)." (at 157.48 133.35 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
